00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:14.040
Russia's draft federal budget would take the cancer program from $44.9 billion to $3.87

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.840
billion in 2027, Euro news reports.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:22.840
That is nearly a 12-fold drop from the $44.9 billion figure, and roughly 38-fold against

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:26.040
$148.5 billion in 2025.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:31.300
five, if the budget passes as written. Defense would reach 35% of all federal spending,

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:36.700
the highest share since the Soviet Union collapsed. The plan shows only a partial rebound to

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:44.680
5.76 billion rubles in 2028 and 12.78 billion in 2029, mostly for diagnostic and radiology

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:50.100
