Canada lost 68,300 jobs in September, a second monthly drop, the Real Economy Blog Reports,

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:54.240
efforts for 110,000 jobs gone across August and September, with the U.S. trade war and

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.900
